        "text": "After D11 the 60/59.50 peaks and 54 trough make a recognized candidate. D12 close 53.50 completes its closing break. Height 6 projects the conventional 48 reference; the next three closes 52, 54, 55 do not reach it. In the alternate branch, D12 close 61.50 invalidates the candidate before completion. Each conclusion follows from the supplied prices and a different explicit question."
