          "question": "Keep every v1.0 rule except the ranking: rank eligible candidates by 20-session mean dollar volume, largest first. Using the screen log, which three candidates receive orders at decision close 0, how many shares each, and how much cash is reserved? Hint: rank first, then size in rank order, deducting each reservation before computing the next cash allowance.",
